# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ignore package manager lockfiles only if generated by tools not used in this repo
# Keep Flutter pubspec.lock committed for apps.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node / npm artifacts are not part of this repository, so no global lock ignore.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large ML model artifacts and generated binaries
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These model artifacts are usually too large for Git and should be stored outside
# the source tree or managed with Git LFS if needed.
# Keep small metadata files like ml/models/labels.json versioned.

gate_1/*.keras
gate_1/*.tflite
gate_2/*.keras
gate_2/*.tflite
ml/models/*.keras
ml/models/*.tflite
ml/models/**/*.pkl
